OL,3,AReform would suspend asylum system for
OL,4,Aparliamentary term if in government
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform UK has announced plans to close
OL,7,Fdown the UK's asylum system for a full
OL,8,Fparliamentary term if it were to enter
OL,9,Fgovernment.
OL,11,FThe party said all new asylum
OL,12,Fapplications would be rejected and
OL,13,Fexisting applications voided, with all
OL,14,Fclaimants marked for deportation, which
OL,15,FReform said would effectively suspend
OL,16,Fthe asylum system.
OL,18,FReform would scrap the asylum tribunal
OL,19,Fsystem, which hears asylum appeal
OL,20,Fcases, and claimants in more than
OL,21,F90,000 outstanding appeals would be
OL,22,Fdeported.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
